.TH DUNGEN 1
.SH NAME
dungen \- dungeon crawl
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/dungen
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I DunGen
is a dungeon crawl.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Move with wasd or the arrows through Terry Davis's fixed, hand-drawn
dungeon, shown in a tilted three-quarter view.
Hold space and press a direction to strike; while space is held every
direction key attacks instead of moving.
Kill all ten monsters; the elapsed time is scored and the best time kept.
Monsters (and the map itself) are only drawn where there is a line of
sight to the player.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B arrows / wasd
Move (or attack direction while space is held)
.TP
.B space
Hold for attack mode (then arrows strike)
.TP
.B Enter / r
Restart
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/dungen.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR draw3d (2),
.IR tone (2),
.IR wm (1)
